---
import { published, releasePage } from '../data/release';
---
{published ? <section class="card"><h2>Download for Windows</h2><p>Version {published.version}</p><p><a class="button" href={published.downloadUrl}>Download {published.windowsFile}</a> <a href={published.pageUrl}>Source code and release notes</a></p><p class="muted">SHA-256: <code>{published.sha256}</code></p><p class="muted">Compare the file checksum before you run it. A checksum confirms the file you downloaded; it is not code signing.</p></section> : <section class="notice"><h2>Windows beta is not published yet</h2><p>The release tag, Windows asset, and checksum are not published, so there is no download link yet.</p><p><a href={releasePage}>Watch GitHub Releases</a></p></section>}
